30	 * <p>This class replaces {@code guava.Preconditions} which provides helpers
31	 * to validate the following conditions:
32	 * <ul>
33	 *   <li>An invalid {@code null} obj causes a {@link NullPointerException}.</li>
34	 *   <li>An invalid argument causes an {@link IllegalArgumentException}.</li>
35	 *   <li>An invalid state causes an {@link IllegalStateException}.</li>
36	 *   <li>An invalid index causes an {@link IndexOutOfBoundsException}.</li>
37	 * </ul>
38	 */
