77	   *
78	   * @param <T> the object type
79	   * @param obj  the object to check
80	   * @param errorMessage  the message associated with the NPE
81	   * @return the validated object
82	   * @throws NullPointerException if the object is {@code null}
83	   * @see #checkNotNull(Object, String, Object...)
84	   */
